is tests recursion one more level. Let's do later.\n\nAlso root \"Download\" might contain files? Let's check if any folder has substantial content: Download date Nov 14 6:41 suggests something was written there maybe by setup. Let's open Download. It might contain a large file used for storage testing. If so, properties of Download should be bigger and background computation noticeable. Good idea. Navigate root and open Download.\n\nClose dialog (13), press Home, open Download."}
